  "Motor de busca de alto desempenho em C++ com suporte a BM25 e indexação em tempo real.",
  "Open-source SQL-oriented full-text search engine with fast BM25 indexing, attribute-based filtering (frontmatter), and optional SphinxSE for PostgreSQL/MySQL, usable locally with a custom MCP wrapper.",
  "A full-text search engine that provides a simple and powerful API for searching data.",
  "Open-source full-text search engine with SQL-like querying, faceted filtering, and pluggable morphological parsers for Portuguese, deployable locally alongside embedding-based search tiers."
